{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"card":1,"entry":2,"missions":28,"alongside":29,"kin":30,"engines":55,"usedOn":56,"sites":61,"crewed":62,"museums":63,"hero":64},"https://www.orrerylearn.com/images/cards/fleet/rd-253.jpg",{"id":3,"name":4,"category":5,"agency":6,"country":7,"manufacturer":8,"first_flight":9,"status":10,"era":11,"epoch":12,"best_known_for":13,"specs":14,"credit":20,"links":21,"tagline":26,"description":27},"rd-253","RD-253","engine","Roscosmos","USSR / Russia","NPO Energomash","1965-07-16","RETIRED","1957-1969","space-race","Proton的自燃推进剂主力发动机——六台推动每一级Proton第一级",{"cycle":15,"propellant":16,"thrust_kn_sl":17,"isp_sl_s":18,"mass_kg":19},"staged-combustion (ox-rich)","N2O4 / UDMH",1470,285,1080,"Engine registry (PRD-032). Public-source nominal specs.",[22],{"l":23,"u":24,"t":25},"RD-253 — Wikipedia","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/RD-253","intro","六台自燃推进剂发动机，驱动每一枚Proton的第一级","RD-253是使Proton成为苏联时代最强大的重型运载火箭之一的发动机。六台RD-253排列在Proton第一级周围，每台都采用以四氧化二氮和偏二甲肼为推进剂的富氧分级燃烧循环——这对自燃推进剂接触即点燃，无需点火系统。这种推进剂有毒且具腐蚀性，但可在室温下储存，赋予Proton在数十年商业和行星探测任务中保持的可靠性。RD-253于1965年7月16日首次飞行，直到Proton退役，每一级Proton第一级都由它提供动力。",[],[],[31,35,39,43,47,51],{"id":32,"name":33,"tagline":34},"rd-107-108","RD-107 / RD-108","Sputnik的发动机——65年后仍在运送航天员",{"id":36,"name":37,"tagline":38},"rd-180","RD-180","俄罗斯富氧分级燃烧技术——美国无法复制",{"id":40,"name":41,"tagline":42},"j-2","J-2","将Apollo送上月球两次的引擎",{"id":44,"name":45,"tagline":46},"f-1","F-1","迄今飞行过的最强力单室发动机",{"id":48,"name":49,"tagline":50},"rl10","RL10","氢上面级，六十年生涯还在继续",{"id":52,"name":53,"tagline":54},"h-1","H-1","八台发动机，八次任务——Saturn I的主力发动机",[],[57],{"id":58,"name":59,"tagline":60},"proton-k","Proton-K","1967–2012 年苏联/俄罗斯的重型运载主力——Salyut、Mir、Venera、Vega 与 Luna 采样返回",[],[],[],"/orrery/images/fleet-galleries/rd-253/01.webp"],"uses":{"params":["id"]}}]}
